DESCRIPTION >
    Super-admin preview: most recent event (any type), for install-status
    display. Tenant-scoped; prunes via (site_id, timestamp). Faithful 1:1 port
    of api/routes/admin.js:210-215 (queryName 'admin_preview_install').
    Typed-column translation (SCOPE_v3.md §2.6): properties.site_id ->
    site_id, event -> event_type. Source has NO event_type filter (matches any
    event) — preserved exactly. No JSON-bag fields. IDENTICAL query text to
    admin_preview_overview.pipe (api/routes/admin.js:350) — duplicate logic
    across two handlers in the same file, flagged as a Phase-6 consolidation
    candidate (noted, not acted on), same treatment as the alert_*/integ_*
    cross-file duplicates from prior batches.
    NOT YET PUSHED — validated read-only via `tb --cloud sql` only.

NODE admin_preview_install_node
SQL >
    %
    SELECT event_type, timestamp
    FROM events
    WHERE site_id = {{ String(site_id, required=True) }}
    ORDER BY timestamp DESC
    LIMIT 1

TYPE endpoint
